        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inye ndyebuga ekisha ky'Omukama n'ekitinwakye, kuhonderana na byona ebyo atutungire. Atungire Abaisiraeli omugisha gungi muno aha rw'enshonga y'obuganyizibwe n'ekishakye ekingi muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akagamba ati, “Omu mazima bonene abo baba bantu bange; baana bange abataligira bugobya.” Mara wenene yashuba yaba Murokozi wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu naku zabo, wenene tiyabashasize. Kandi ti mumalaika shana Omukama wenene n'iwe yabarokoire. Akabagilira engonzi n'obufura yabachungura. Kwema akarai kona n'iwe yatulindaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai bakamugomera bamujunaza Omutakatifu, aho nawe yaba mubisha wabo yabarashanisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma baijuka amakiro ag'eirai, aga Musa omwiru w'Omukama. Bayebaza bati, “Mbwenu Omukama alihai ayarabize abatwazi b'eihangalye omu nyanja? Alihai Omukama ayabahaire Mwoyowe Omutakatifu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alihai ayahaire Musa obushobora kukora eby'okutangaza? Alihai Omukama ayabasiize enyanja, kwema aho akabona eiranga elitalihwaho eirai lyona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabarabya omu nyanja engundu?” Bakashusha okwo efarasi eraba omw'irungu, tibasitaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwoyo w'Omukama akabatunga emilembe, nk'okwo basongora ente omu ruhanga rw'eitonjo. Akebembera abantube abone kuhaisa eibaralye ekitinwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waitu Mukama, osinge oyeme omw'iguru, omu businge bwawe obutakatifu mara obw'ekitinwa otulebe. Ekihika kyawe eky'otugilira n'amani gawe bili nkahai? Tokitugonza, kandi tokitugilira mbabazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba iwe oba isheichwe. Aburahamu na Isiraeli titulikutumanya, kyonkai iwe, waitu Mukama, ni iwe oba Isheichwe, kwema karai eibara lyawe tukweta “Muchunguzi waitu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waitu Mukama, watuleka twasigilira entwaza zawe, watugumanganisa emitima twalekera kukutina? Singa ogaruke, twakutaho abairu bawe, eihanga lyawe nyabwawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichwe eihanga lyawe elitakatifu. Yerusalemu ekaba yaitu akanya kagufi. Mbwenu nekandagilirwa ababisha baitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twashusire oti tokabaga Mukama waitu, oti titukabaga bantu bawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
